## Control {{controlId}}: Create and Retain System Audit Logs and Records

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization creates and retains system audit logs within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through Entra ID sign-in logs, directory audit logs, and Exchange Online mailbox auditing managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if signInLogsAvailable}}
**Sign-In Audit Logs:**
{{signInLogsCount}} sign-in events captured with {{retentionDays}}-day retention:
{{#if logs}}
{{#each logs}}
- **{{userPrincipalName}}** — App: {{appDisplayName}} — Status: {{status}} — {{createdDateTime}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Sign-in logs capture all authentication events including user principal name, application accessed, IP address, device compliance status, Conditional Access policy results, and MFA verification details.
{{else}}
Sign-in log creation has not been confirmed. Authentication event auditing is not verified.
{{/if}}

{{#if directoryAuditsAvailable}}
**Directory Audit Logs:**
{{directoryAuditsCount}} administrative actions recorded:
{{#if audits}}
{{#each audits}}
- **{{activityDisplayName}}** by {{actorUserPrincipalName}} — Result: {{result}} — {{activityDateTime}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Directory audits capture configuration changes, role assignments, group membership modifications, and policy updates with full actor attribution.
{{else}}
Directory audit log creation has not been confirmed.
{{/if}}

{{#if mailboxAuditEnabled}}
**Mailbox Auditing:**
Exchange Online mailbox auditing is enabled. Default audit operations captured for: {{#each defaultAuditSet}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} actions. {{#if auditBypassEnabled}}Warning: Audit bypass is enabled for some mailboxes.{{/if}}
{{else}}
Mailbox auditing has not been confirmed.
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Examine sign-in log entries, directory audit records, mailbox audit configuration, and retention policy settings.

{{#if evidenceArtifacts}}
**Evidence:**
{{#each evidenceArtifacts}}
- {{label}}
{{/each}}
{{else}}
**Evidence:** {{evidenceArtifactUrl}}
{{/if}}
